From a95093c04ecc0b459abcbb9eb23b6b4c3789eb34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mikekinney@Mikes-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:55:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): a saved .mch keeps the key order it was read in

The machine draft records each object's key order from the source text
(machine::order::KeyOrder, a serde visitor) and writes through its own
pretty writer in that order; new keys go last in their object. No new
dependency, no workspace preserve_order; project files are untouched.

Fixes #480

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
